WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Conduction • heat without bulk movement
Heat passes from burner to pot and along its handle through contact. The handle does not flow.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Convection • moving material carries heat
Follow individual parcels around the cells. Moving water carries heat away from the hot base.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Radiation • energy travels as waves
Hot lava emits electromagnetic radiation. Energy crosses the space above the lava without carrying rock with it.
